Welcome to the SAM9X60 MediCam
==============================

Serial console: 115200 8N1 on the DBGU port.
SSH:            root@<hostname>  (the hostname is medicam-<6 hex digits of the eth0 MAC>)
Persistent data: /data (on NAND from stage 1.5), /home is a symlink into it.

The root password is set at build time (BR2_TARGET_GENERIC_ROOT_PASSWD in
configs/sam9x60_medicam_defconfig) - see README.md in this directory.
